---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  description={`I'm a software engineer in Kamra, Pakistan. Currently at XTEL, previously Tasq and BriteCore. I write about backend work and things learned along the way.`}
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <section class="section-about">
    <header class="section-about__intro">
      <img
        class="section-about__portrait"
        src="/assets/img/portrait.png"
        alt="Pencil sketch portrait of Waseem Jan"
        width="512"
        height="512"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <h1 class="heading-2 heading-2--dark">About</h1>
    </header>

    <p class="text text--lead mb-lg">
      Software engineer in Kamra, Pakistan. I studied at the <a href="https://giki.edu.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GIK Institute</a>. Full stack, though I spend more time on the backend.
      I care about making complicated systems behave in ways you can actually understand.
    </p>

    <p class="text">
      These days I'm at XTEL, on promotion and pricing tools for consumer goods companies. Before
      that: Tasq, BriteCore, and co-founding <strong>Chef Galaxy</strong>, a chef marketplace I
      built end to end that didn't last, but taught me a lot. Longer versions are on <a href="/work">Work</a> and the <a href="/blog">Blog</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="text">
      At home I'm with my wife <b>Yusaira</b> and our sons <b>Azlan</b> and <b>Zaman</b>. I keep an
      aviary of cockatiel parrots
      <svg
        class="section-about__bird"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        width="18"
        height="18"
        aria-hidden="true"
        focusable="false"
      >
        <path fill="currentColor" d="M12.2 1.8 L13.6 8 H11.4 Z" />
        <path fill="currentColor" d="M14.4 2.4 L15 8 H13 Z" />
        <path fill="currentColor" d="M15.8 3.6 L16.2 8.2 H14.6 Z" />
        <ellipse cx="14" cy="15.2" rx="5.2" ry="5.8" fill="currentColor" />
        <circle cx="10.2" cy="10.2" r="4.2" fill="currentColor" />
        <circle cx="9.2" cy="9.6" r="0.7" fill="#fff" />
        <circle cx="8.6" cy="11.2" r="1.25" fill="#d96b2f" />
        <path fill="currentColor" d="M6.2 9.8 L3.6 11 L6.2 12.2 Z" />
      </svg>, and I like building and fixing things around the house.
    </p>

    <p class="text">
      Say hello at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
